    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahazi yaafuuka kyabazinga ng'agheza emyaka amakumi abiri egy'obukulu, era yaafugira entangama ya myaka ikumi na mukaaga mu Yerusalemu. Tiyajiiranga ku mpisa nungi edha dhaadha we Daudi, eyakolanga ebituufu Musengwa Katonda we by'asiima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye yaajiiranga ku mpisa embi edha bakyabazinga ba Isiraeli, era yaakola n'ebifaananie by'emisambwa Baali, mu kyuma ekisaanuusiibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaaniokezanga obubbaani mu kiiko kya mutabane wa Hinnomu. Yaatuuka n'okwokyanga batabane be ng'ebigheebwayo, ng'empisa eyenhinhalwa bweyali ey'abamaghanga agandi, Musengwa Katonda be yabinga mu nsi eyo nga Abaisiraeli bali kumpi okutuukayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaaghangayo emisengo era yaaniokezanga obubbaani mu bifo ebigulumivu eby'okusinzizaamu, ni ku nsozi, na buli ghansi mu kinsense kya muti muzibirivu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
