            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.16.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bakyab 16:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.7.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 7:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Olw'ebibi ebyo Ahazi bye yakola, Musengwa Katonda we kyeyava n'amughaayo ye kyabazinga w'e Siria, yaamughangula, era yaatwala abantu be kamaala inho e Damasiko, nga basibe. Kabiri Musengwa Katonda oyo yaamughaayo ye kyabazinga Peka owa Isiraeli, yaamughangula ng'aise n'abantu be kamaala inho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Peka oyo mutabane wa Remalia yaita mu Bayudaaya abantu emitwalo ikumi n'ebiri (120,000) mu lunaku lulala, olw'okuba baava ku Musengwa Katonda, oyo Katonda wa badhaadha baibwe. Abantu abo boonaboona baali abasaadha abaziramu ntete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ate Zikuri omulwani ow'amaani Omuisiraeli ow'omu kika kya Efuraimu, yaita Maaseia mutabane wa kyabazinga Ahazi, ni Azurikamu eyalabiriranga ekisaagaati kya kyabazinga, ni Elukana eyaiririranga kyabazinga mu buyinza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisiraeli baagema abakazi Abayudaaya, n'abaana abalenzi n'abaghala, emitwalo amakumi abiri (200,000), baabatwala nga basibe waire nga Abayudaaya abo baluganda lwaibwe. Era baabatoolaku n'ebintu kamaala ng'omunhago omunhago ogwo baagutwala e Samaria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye ghaaligho omulanzi wa Musengwa Katonda ng'aba Samaria, eriina lye nga ni Odedi. Oyo yaaja okweisuusaayo eigye nga liri kwira e Samaria, yaabakoba ati: “Bona eno, olw'okuba Musengwa Katonda, Katonda wa badhaadha baimwe yasungughalira ab'omu Buyudaaya, kyaviire n'abaghaayo ye muli okubaghangula. Aye mperaano awuliire engeri ye mubaiseemu n'obukambwe obutaloodheka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ate imwe buti muli kwenda kufuula abantu b'omu Buyudaaya n'ab'omu Yerusalemu, abasaadha n'abakazi, babe bairu baimwe. Aye obwo imwe muzirakuuku bibi byaimwe, bye mwakola ni musungughaza Musengwa Katonda waimwe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ni muwulirise kye nkoba, mwizeeyo abasibe abo kuba baluganda lwaimwe. Bwe mutaakole mutyo, Musengwa Katonda aidha kubabonereza n'obukambwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho abandi ku bakulembeze, boona nga ba mu kika kya Efuraimu, baatakania abo abaali bali kwira okuva mu lutalo. Abakulembeze abo nga ni bano: Azaria mutabane wa Yohanani, ni Berekia mutabane wa Meshillemothi, ni Yehizekia mutabane wa Shallumu, ni Amasa mutabane wa Hadulai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baakoba abo abaali bali kwira okuva mu lutalo, bati: “Timwidha kuleeta ghano basibe abo. Ife twakola ebibi twasungughaza Musengwa Katonda mu Isiraeli, era tuli n'omusango munene. Aye ate imwe muli kwenda kwongereza ku bibi bye twakola, ni ku musango gwe tuli nagwo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho abaisirukale baaleka abasibe n'omunhago mu maiso g'abakulembeze n'ag'abantu boonaboona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho abasaadha bale ab'omu kika kya Efuraimu aboogeirwaku baasituka, baatwala abasibe abaali amadu, baabagha engoye nga batoola ku munhago baabavaaza era baabagha n'engaito. Baabafunira eby'okulya n'eby'okunhwa, era baabasiiga omuzigo ogw'ebibala eby'emiti emyoliva. Abo abaali nga baziramu maani baabatwalira ku ndogoyi, baabatuusa mu boluganda lwaibwe e Yeriko, ekibuga eky'emiti eminaazi. Agho Abaisiraeli bairayo e Samaria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu biseera ebyo, kyabazinga Ahazi yaasaba kyabazinga w'e Assiria okumubeera, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuba Abaedomu baali kabiri nga balumbye ab'omu Buyudaaya, baabaghangula era baatwala n'abasibe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafilisiti boona nga balumbye ebibuga eby'omu biketezo eby'omu biiko bya Buyudaaya. Baagema ebibuga bino era baabibaamu: Bethi Shemeshi, ni Aiyaloni, ni Gederothi, ni Soko ghalala n'ebyalo byakyo, ni Timuna ghalala n'ebyalo byakyo, ni Gimuzo ghalala n'ebyalo byakyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo byaligho, kuba kyabazinga Ahazi oyo yakola eidhoogo mu Buyudaaya era yaaloba kuba mwesigwa eri Musengwa Katonda, yaaleetera Musengwa Katonda okusindika ebizibu ku Buyudaaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era kyabazinga Tigulathi Pileseri ow'e Assiria bwe yaidha, tiyayamba Ahazi naire, aye yamukiriga bukirige, yaayongera bwa kumweraliikiriza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahazi yaatoola ku bintu ebyali mu isinzizo, ni mu kisaagaati kye eky'obwakyabazinga, ni mu ndhu edh'abakungu, yaabigha kyabazinga w'e Assiria oyo, aye era byona ghazira kye byamuyamba naire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga Ahazi oyo, ni mu kiseera kye yabeeramu mu buzibu, yeeyongera bweyongere okukola ebibi eri Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaaghaayo emisengo eri bakatonda b'e Damasiko abaamughangula, ng'akoba ati: “Bakatonda b'e Siria baayamba bakyabazinga baayo, zeena ka mbaghe emisengo baanhambe.” Aye byamuviiramu bwa kuzikirira, mwene n'ensi ye yoonayoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Ahazi yaasoloza ebintu ebikozesebwa mu isinzizo, yaabimenhamenha byonabyona. Yaigalagho eisinzizo, yeekolera alutaari mu buli kifo mu Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
