          "text": "Ebindi byonabyona Ahazi bye yakola, n'empisa dhe dhoonadhoona, okuva mu mainhama okutuuka ku nkomerero, byaghandiikibwa mu Kitabo kya Bakyabazinga ba Buyudaaya n'aba Isiraeli. ",
